WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.215
Season asks, what goals will you progress this
quarter? Your list

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:08.179
might include a walking rhythm, a usable spare
room, and a

00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:08.900
family weekend.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.050
A walking rhythm supports your yearly wish for
more time outdoors.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Making the spare room usable supports a calmer
home.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:24.342
A family weekend supports staying close to
family. You choose these

00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:24.850
connections.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.668
Follow the home goal down. Making the spare
room usable this

00:00:28.668 --> 00:00:32.137
quarter can hold a smaller goal: clear the
floor this month.

00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:35.605
Sort one box is an activity you might choose
for this

00:00:35.605 --> 00:00:39.073
week, then today. These are nested goals and
their actions. Your

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:40.650
quarterly goal stays in place.
